-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §43 קצובת ביגוד: from the school year
-- תשע"ב — the allowance paid with the salary of July 2012 — every teaching
-- employee is entitled to the clothing allowance at the tariff of level 4,
-- whatever his professional seniority; the allowance's other rules are
-- unchanged.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `43 קצובת ביגוד`

-- ¶1: from the school year תשע"ב, "דהיינו – הקצובה המשולמת במשכורת חודש
-- יולי 2012" (convention dates.salary-month): the allowance of a school
-- year is paid with July's salary, so the first to which the section
-- speaks is the one paid in July 2012. Every teaching employee (§4(א)) is
-- entitled to it at the tariff of level 4, "ללא קשר לותקם המקצועי". The
-- tariff of a level is the one the Accountant General at the Treasury
-- publishes, an amount set elsewhere (convention amounts.inputs); before
-- תשע"ב the level is the one the rules give by seniority, which are not
-- this agreement's.
@ref akn:art_43/p1
`the clothing allowance level section 43 gives` MEANS 4

`the first salary month of section 43` MEANS `the Oz salary month` 2012 7

GIVEN `the salary month the allowance is paid in` IS A NUMBER @desc as `the Oz salary month` counts it
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance level under section 43 paid in` `the salary month the allowance is paid in` IS
    IF `the salary month the allowance is paid in` AT LEAST `the first salary month of section 43`
    THEN JUST `the clothing allowance level section 43 gives`
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN `the salary month the allowance is paid in` IS A NUMBER
      `the tariff of level 4` IS A NUMBER @desc as the Accountant General at the Treasury published it for that year
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance under section 43 paid in` `the salary month the allowance is paid in` `the tariff of level 4` IS
    IF `the salary month the allowance is paid in` AT LEAST `the first salary month of section 43`
    THEN JUST `the tariff of level 4`
    ELSE NOTHING

`why the clothing allowance's tariff is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "החשב הכללי במשרד האוצר, המפרסם את תעריפי קצובת הביגוד לפי רמות"

-- ¶2: the section does not change the other rules on paying the clothing
-- allowance (the teacher's position, the months he is entitled for, and
-- the rest), which are not this agreement's.
@ref akn:art_43/p2
`why the clothing allowance's other rules are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים החלים בעניין תשלום קצובת ביגוד, מחוץ להסכם זה"

§§ `43 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `the clothing allowance level under section 43 paid in` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 7) EQUALS JUST 4
#ASSERT `the clothing allowance level under section 43 paid in` (`the Oz salary month` 2011 7) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the clothing allowance under section 43 paid in` (`the Oz salary month` 2013 7) 1500 EQUALS JUST 1500
